          "description": "The Automation Technical Decision Point (TDP) positions Red Hat Ansible Automation Platform as the mission-critical foundation for modernizing IT, using a unified governance framework to consolidate fragmented tools and deliver measurable outcomes like 68% faster deployments and reduced downtime."
        },
        {
          "type": "tdp",
          "name": "AIOps:Turn Intelligence into Action",
          "description": "This AIOps tactic positions Red Hat Ansible Automation Platform as the \"action layer\" that transforms monitoring insights into automated remediation, enabling IT teams to replace manual troubleshooting with event-driven workflows that optimize costs and ensure AI policy compliance."
        },
        {
          "type": "tdp",
          "name": "Optimize and Modernize IT Ops",
          "description": "This tactic positions Red Hat Ansible Automation Platform as a unified foundation to eliminate tool silos and operational debt, allowing sellers to demonstrate how centralized governance secures immediate operational wins while accelerating strategic initiatives like VM modernization and cloud migration."
